<title>USA: Tower Air Feb load factor declines.</title>
<headline>Tower Air Feb load factor declines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Month Ended February 28,</p>
<p>					1997	 1996	 Change</p>
<p>Total block hours flown	1,924	2,519	-23.6%</p>
<p>Available seat miles</p>
<p>    (millions)(a)		  256	  324	-21.0%</p>
<p>Revenue passengers carried</p>
<p>    (thousands)(a)		  67	   86	-22.1%</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles</p>
<p>    (millions)(a)		   172	  225	-23.6%</p>
<p>Passenger service load</p>
<p>    factor(a)			67.2%	69.4%	-2.2 pts.</p>
<p>					Two Months Ended February 28,</p>
<p>					1997	 1996	 Change</p>
<p>Total block hours flown	4,338	5,649	-23.2%</p>
<p>Available seat miles</p>
<p>    (millions)(a)		  575	  736	-21.9%</p>
<p>Revenue passengers carried</p>
<p>    (thousands)(a)		 151	  185	-18.4%</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles</p>
<p>    (millions)(a)		  388	  508	-23.6%</p>
<p>Passenger service load</p>
<p>    factor(a)		     67.5%	69.0%	-1.5 pts.</p>
<p>(a) Scheduled Passenger Service</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is Tower Air Inc.</p>
